## Memory

At startup, read `{{MEMORY_DIR}}/MEMORY.md` — it indexes everything you have learned across past sessions. When a topic in the index is relevant to an incoming message, read the linked file before answering.

You have permission to add to that directory whenever you learn something durable. Each entry in MEMORY.md is a one-line markdown link with a short hook; the file itself has YAML front matter (`name`, `description`, `type` — one of project, reference, feedback, user).
